cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software when using Urban Cybernetics. Version 1.0.0 is
  prepared for release; the related dataset and evidence DOIs are reserved
  and do not identify a published software release.
  Cork GraphML dataset (ODbL-1.0; © OpenStreetMap contributors):
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22981344.
  Paper 1 evidence archive 1.0.0:
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23000309.
  Project-generated evidence is CC BY 4.0 unless otherwise stated;
  embedded OpenStreetMap-derived database portions remain ODbL 1.0.
  Third-party source material not licensed for redistribution is excluded.
type: software
title: Urban Cybernetics
version: 1.0.0
license: MPL-2.0
authors:
  - given-names: Cillian
    family-names: Ó Ríordáin
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-2831-5380
repository-code: https://github.com/CORBlimey21/urban-cybernetics
abstract: >-
  Research software for packet-based traffic loading with explicit network
  provenance, observations, routing information, and deterministic replay
  evidence. Includes analytical validation, digitised reference comparisons,
  junction representation and fractional-service experiments, OSM compiler
  cases, synthetic demand scaling, and bounded information-routing experiments.
keywords:
  - traffic simulation
  - link transmission model
  - urban cybernetics
  - reproducible research
  - network provenance
# Software DOI, paper citation and date-released are intentionally omitted:
# none has been established for this unreleased software version.
